{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着微軟、Opera、Vivaldi 等廠商廣泛採用 Chromium，當前瀏覽器市場的底層引擎選擇已相當有限。用户如今基本只能在 Chromium 的 Blink、Safari 的 WebKit，以及 Firefox 的 Gecko 之間進行選擇。不過，Ladybird 瀏覽器的首個 Alpha 版本現已面向 macOS 和 Linux 推出，為用户提供了另一種真正獨立的瀏覽器方案。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587736.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:43:55.433096+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:29:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_hash":"6e3f45c541e88ad5744a2cc9176c41f7f8b9d63ee528480dec6cbbd5605a4568","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}